{"data":{"body":"[P1] The result is still returned from inside the `ExecutionManager` try-with-resources, with no `throwIfScopeFatal` after manager closure. If handoff times out and a scope reports `ThreadDeath`/`VirtualMachineError` while an end hook or shutdown is blocked, `scopeFatal` is set before `execute` returns but the caller still receives PENDING/RETRYING. Store the selected result or exception, close the manager, perform a final fatal check, then return or rethrow it.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76fiaI","finding_digest":"5944175c7faa8fd30d7a603075dc2afe7e9726af48f33d923651740f246bc428","finding_id":"arf_v1_lfcboxd7vkh5gdl2mayhlxbk7z","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-scope-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-scope-cleanup-propagation","line":142,"observation_digest":"15daaf86e7d734affc0df18eba1df17bc35624d18f3a85ba4cecc24f2a82c019","observation_id":"aro_v1_cxnk7bxh242k77an6ghluhprpp","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_lfcboxd7vkh5gdl2mayhlxbk7z","published_at":"2026-10-07T02:50:54Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3xkciusmv2zl3f6jby76ixmaou","reviewed_base_sha":"34c174f2819f715cf26e88aa8dbabd7d40cb9ad8","reviewed_head_sha":"ee73b45ea3e69aa07e068d31449fcf6035ccabf2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":142,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_hp4mfvwjamjlq4czntri3e77ty","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T02:50:54Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
